<!--
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  ARABIC — DEFAULT / PRIMARY BUNDLE
  Arabic is the design language of EduMind, so it lives in values/ (the
  fallback bundle) and English lives in values-en/.
  RULES (Design System §6, Rork Knowledge §2):
    • No user-facing literal text may appear in a composable. Ever.
    • Every key added here is added to values-en/strings.xml in the SAME change.
    • Counts use <plurals> with all six Arabic forms. A `if (n == 1)` is a bug.
    • Never concatenate fragments — full sentences with placeholders only.
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
